    "description": "The Best Free Private HD Video Downloader & video Saver app for You. With the 4x faster download speeds. it would be the best video downloader choice for you.\r\n\r\nDownload Hub helps you download all the videos from the internet with just one click and it also provides you with different Resolution options so that you can choose the quality of the video that you like and download it.\r\nDownload Hub has built-in browser with multiple tabs and with amazing UI design.\r\nDownload Hub is All in one downloader\r\n\r\nWhy choose Download Hub :\r\n* Private browser and fast video downloader\r\n* Play videos while downloading them in background, cool right?\r\n* Multiple downloads at the same time.\r\n* 1000+ websites supported and new added each day.\r\n* Auto finds all the videos and their resolutions instantly.\r\n* Saves mobile data/network bandwidth by limiting network requests to resources.\r\n* Finds all the video quality options automatically.\r\n* Beautiful UI design and easy to use.\r\n* Easy to download any video from any website.\r\n* save your favorite videos with just one click.\r\n* Our fast downloader auto detects videos and fast download with one click\r\n* private video vault to hide your private videos.\r\n* create private albums/folders to organize your private videos.\r\n* App lock feature to prevent anyone from accessing your private videos.\r\n\r\nPlaylist Feature\r\n* Create online playlist without downloading videos just like Youtube, Spotify playlists.\r\n* Playlists feature is supported across 1000+ websites, All in one app.\r\n* your don't have to create multiple account with multiple websites to save your favorite videos online. Our app can save online videos with just one account.\r\n* You can create your own playlists as per your need e.g. \"Watch later\", \"My favs\", \"Trending\".. etc.\r\n\r\nPrivate browser\r\nWant to browse privately? You need a private browser. This private browser app allows you to browse without leaving any traces and keeps you safe.\r\n\r\nApp Lock\r\n* Keep your privacy safe.\r\n\r\nVideos vault / private gallery\r\n* hide your videos in a private album.\r\n* your videos are hidden from gallery and can only be accessible within app.\r\n* watch videos offline.\r\n\r\nBuilt-in Browser Features :\r\n* Browse videos with the built-in browser\r\n* Open multiple tabs while downloading videos\r\n* Auto-detects videos and finds their resolution, duration, file size, thumbnails instantly (no delay).\r\n* Provides different Search engines (e.g. Bing, duckduckgo, etc) options.\r\n* Safe Browsing feature to protect you from harmful websites.\r\n* Bookmark your favorite websites\r\n* Keeps your browser history safe\r\n* Has Desktop site option to allow you to open sites in desktop mode.\r\n\r\nHow to Use Download Hub :\r\n* Browse website with the built-in browser.\r\n* Play the video that you want to download.\r\n* Then tap the download button.\r\n* Choose the video resolution that you want to download.\r\n* After download completes, video will be auto-exported to gallery.\r\n* Done!\r\n\r\nAdd Shortcuts to websites :\r\n* Add Shortcuts to your favorite websites in Home page for easy access.\r\n* manage shortcuts.\r\n\r\nDownload Manager Features :\r\n* Multi-Threaded to provide best performance and download multiple videos at the same time.\r\n* You can play videos while downloading to save data.\r\n* Auto-Export videos to Gallery.\r\n* Fast download speeds.\r\n* You can Pause/Resume/Cancel downloads.\r\n* Resume failed downloads.\r\n* Check progress in the download bar.\r\n* Support all formats, MP4, WEBM, OGG, M4S, TS.\r\n* Download videos and social media clips in HD quality from all social websites\r\n* Download unlimited videos for free\r\n* HD / 2K / 4K videos download supported\r\n\r\nNOTE : Download Hub doesn't support Youtube downloads to comply with play store policy.\r\ndisclaimer : Please get the permission from the owner before you repost videos. Any unauthorized actions (e.g. re-posting or downloading of contents) and/or violations of intellectual property rights is the sole responsibility of the user.\r\n* Downloading files protected by copyright is prohibited and regulated by the law of the country.",
